{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2026-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1772928000, "end_date": 1773619199, "month_true_total": 21, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:12:06 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "220714986", "author": {"steamid": "76561199405427302", "personaname": "tacoman2344", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199405427302/", "num_games_owned": 30, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 293, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 273, "last_played": 1785990679, "avatar": "a6073a15c563646efa5599dd1a708d63ab3daf3f"}, "language": "english", "review": "medic main", "timestamp_created": 1773553135, "timestamp_updated": 1773553135, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220629694", "author": {"steamid": "76561199104673632", "personaname": "zumbadogadiel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kingofrock123456/", "num_games_owned": 75, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 293, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 293, "last_played": 1773453985, "avatar": "cfaf6917f47ca6122396f46e485a79a090f29fa0"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is amazing. It’s a lot of fun and incredibly easy to pick up and play. The controls are simple and responsive, and it runs perfectly even on my “potato” of a gaming laptop. It was especially fun playing with 1–3 friends, and the atmosphere really adds to the experience. At times it genuinely makes you feel like you’re part of a squad of different sci-fi soldiers, similar to Helldivers, Space Marines, or Colonial Marines.\n\nThat said, while I would still recommend this game, the sequel (Alien Swarm: Reactive Drop) largely makes it obsolete. Everything good about this game is present in the sequel, along with many improvements and additional features.\n\nOverall, I’d still recommend giving it a try—especially since it’s FREE and only about 2GB. It’s easy to download and jump into, and if you enjoy it, you should definitely check out the sequel.", "timestamp_created": 1773472455, "timestamp_updated": 1773472455, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.53947371244430542", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220544215", "author": {"steamid": "76561198332816750", "personaname": "Gold4310", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/idonthaveadog/", "num_games_owned": 342, "num_reviews": 162, "playtime_forever": 52, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 52, "last_played": 1773007241, "avatar": "a20f3a95e0386b79488d779565b8a72a16fb240b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty fun, never heard much about the game, but it surpassed my expectations. I probably should have saw that coming since this is a Valve game", "timestamp_created": 1773380316, "timestamp_updated": 1773380316, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220470933", "author": {"steamid": "76561197981181893", "personaname": "Tetsuo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197981181893/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 1149, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtim